## Leaders in Training

Our L.I.T. program is a unique servant leadership experience for high school students. Grow in faith, develop leadership skills, and make a real impact on campers' lives.

- For students who have completed 9th grade through graduating seniors
- Hands-on leadership development
- Bible study and spiritual mentoring

{% ctaButton
